e laboratory GWP100 <= 150 policy while retaining acceptable timing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The recommended 1.98 mm gap lies within the allowed 1--3 mm range.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Finish by submitting one recommended mixture and gas gap.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submitted one recommendation: Mixture-G1 at 1.98 mm.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "call_id": "call_2dea523df6a34cad92371a6bdaf5df14", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_05959838aa2fa81c006b02bc431bd487d08354431b99b214c6", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
